gridsnap (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Localize the user interface into English and Chinese (gettext catalogs
    for the Python tools and the Cinnamon applet); Russian is the source
    language and needs no catalog.
  * Translate the manual pages into English and Chinese and install all pages
    per language (man-db picks ru and zh_CN by locale, English is the default).
  * Ship the MIT license with the package.
  * Document hot corners in the manual and add the gridsnap-hotcorners manual
    page alias for the installed command.

 -- metapeka <188594035+metapeka@users.noreply.github.com>  Sun, 22 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0300

gridsnap (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Первая сборка штатным пакетом Debian (debian/ + debhelper):
    debian/install раскладывает код в /usr/lib/gridsnap, запускалки
    gridsnap-tiler/gridsnap-daemon/gridsnap-editor/setup-hotkeys — в /usr/bin,
    ярлык и иконки — в /usr/share. Состав пакета совпадает с целью `make deb`.

 -- metapeka <188594035+metapeka@users.noreply.github.com>  Fri, 20 Nov 2026 04:00:00 +0300
